listing:   F9-67 robot image (robot.cc, robot.dts, robot.config) and press.py
toolchain: QEMU emulator version 8.2.2 (Debian 1:8.2.2+ds-0ubuntu1.18); aarch64-linux-gnu-g++ (Ubuntu 13.3.0-6ubuntu2~24.04.1) 13.3.0
command:   qemu-system-aarch64 -M virt,acpi=off -cpu cortex-a53 -m 256M -display none -serial stdio -monitor unix:mon.sock,server,nowait -semihosting -kernel Image -dtb robot.dtb -append "robot.cycles=8000" & python3 press.py mon.sock 1.0
date:      2026-10-10T01:50:43Z
machine:   Linux x86_64, 4 CPUs (cloud build container, a virtual machine)
exit code: 0
note:      exit code 0 = e-stop seen, safe state held, and no non-zero actuator command after it
hardware:  untested on hardware; run in QEMU (qemu-system-aarch64 -M virt), not on a real robot computer
